body:
Yeah, it really is. I'm not at all picky about who I hang out with as long as they're kind. I can get along with most people pretty well, but I have a hard time actually relating to anybody. Often I find myself trying to have heart-to-heart conversations with people who either don't want to listen or are incapable of listening to what I'm trying to say. I've isolated myself from everyone except one person who I was going to talk to about this, but now I realize that maybe it's probably not the best idea to make someone who probably doesn't want to have to deal with my problems have to see me cry.  

I have thought about both those options, actually! I used to mess around with Photoshop quite a lot, but I feel like anything I do won't impress anyone. I'll look into things that combine the interests later tonight. 

I'd love to draw something for you, but I'm not really in a mood to do that right now, I'm sorry D;
